gate: CLOSED
v:4 c:$$ m:navitrack-config role:planner
sprint: S19
title: Design Shell Closeout
epic: E16
priority: P1
dep: S18
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV, BUN, QA, ARCHITECT, MOBILE_TAURI]
invariants: ../S16-INVARIANTS.md
s18_invariants: ../S18-INVARIANTS.md
test_mandate: ../intel/TEST-COVERAGE-MANDATE.md
quality_mandate: ../intel/CODE-QUALITY-MANDATE.md
intake:
  - "Freeze the unplanned visual pass already in navitrack-config-app"
  - "Close rename, empty/error, and ScreenHeader rhythm gaps — Web + FakeBle"
  - "Design nits: screen name in the header, version once, honest welcome button, About"
  - "Sensor-profile template for more products; one live fuel profile now"
  - "First ship apps are iOS and Android; macOS build stays for real-sensor testing"
  - "Field safety: confirm DUT writes, hide opcodes from installers, keep the focused field"
  - "Prove Vitest + Playwright; re-check Tauri BLE factory without a DUT"
  - "TQ before the sprint can close"
open_for_append: false
planning_status: drafted
planned: 2026-09-30

objective: |
  E16 closeout of the design shell. Do not redesign. Do not reopen S18.
  S18-T0 live BLE smoke stays deferred until a DUT is present.
  Shell stays Welcome → Home → Catalog → sensor session.
  Settings stay in the AppHeader sheet. Brand stays NaviTrack.
  Amend, on explicit intake: Home is the primary bottom tab; saved-sensor rules;
  scan shows advertise telemetry whenever manufacturer data is present
  (S18 autoConnect display gate no longer hides it).
  Header text is the current screen, not the word NaviTrack. Version once, on About.
  Welcome enters Home and is not labeled Scan (amends the S16 scan-CTA label).
  Catalog stays data-driven; session binds to a sensor profile. One live fuel profile.
  First ship binaries: iOS and Android. macOS compile stays for DUT testing.
  A write to the sensor asks first. Installer screens hide opcode numbers.
  A focused session field stays on screen. Leaving unwritten edits asks.
  Sequence A → B → F → G → C → D → E. Sprint stays open until E (TQ) is done.
  OUT: new protocol commands, FCS changes, App Store / Play upload, live radio,
  a second live sensor, RS-485, GPS tile, cloud account, full report wizard,
  thermocompensation, desktop COM, reverting Welcome → Home → Catalog.

